DescTools::BinomCI(events[1],sum(events),method = "clopper-pearson") -> p_est



data.frame(IDR = p_est[1]/(1-p_est[1])*mult,
           IDR_lower = p_est[2]/(1-p_est[2])*mult,
          IDR_higher = p_est[3]/(1-p_est[3])*mult) |> gt::gt()
```

